<title>UK: Racal unit wins five-year CashStop contract.</title>
<headline>Racal unit wins five-year CashStop contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Racal Electronics Plc said on Thursday that its Racal-Transcom unit had won a bill payments network contract worth seven million stg over five years.</p>
<p>It will supply and support tailor-made terminals to CashStop, a national bill payments network for utility and service company customers.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
